<P STYLE="font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; margin: 0pt 0; color: #004699">XORTX THERAPEUTICS INC.</P>

<P STYLE="font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; margin: 0pt 0">Management Discussion and Analysis</P>

<P STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: center; margin: 0pt 0"><B>For the six months ended June 30, 2026</B></P>

<P STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt 0">This management discussion and analysis of financial position and results
of operations <B>(&ldquo;MD&amp;A&rdquo;</B>) is prepared as at August 13, 2026 and should be read in conjunction with the unaudited condensed
interim consolidated financial statements for the three and six months ended June 30, 2026 and 2025 of XORTX Therapeutics Inc. (the &ldquo;<B>Company</B>&rdquo;
or &ldquo;<B>XORTX</B>&rdquo;), together with the audited financial statements of the Company for the years ended December 31, 2025 and
2024, as well as the accompanying MD&amp;A for the period then ended (the &ldquo;<B>Annual MD&amp;A</B>&rdquo;).</P>

<P STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt 0">The referenced unaudited condensed interim consolidated financial statements
have been prepared in accordance with International Financial Reporting Standards (&ldquo;<B>IFRS</B>&rdquo;), including International
Accounting Standard 34, Interim Financial Reporting, as issued by the International Accounting Standards Board (&ldquo;<B>IASB</B>&rdquo;)
and Interpretations of the IFRS Interpretations Committee (&ldquo;<B>IFRIC</B>&rdquo;). All dollar amounts included therein and in the
following MD&amp;A are expressed in United States dollars except where noted.</P>

<P STYLE="font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt 0">The Company&rsquo;s critical accounting estimates, significant accounting
policies, and risk factors as disclosed in the Annual MD&amp;A have remained substantially unchanged and are still applicable to the Company
unless otherwise indicated.</P>

<P STYLE="font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt 0">In this discussion, unless the context requires otherwise, references to
&ldquo;we&rdquo; or &ldquo;our&rdquo; are references to XORTX Therapeutics Inc.</P>

<P STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt 0; color: #004699">CORPORATE INFORMATION</P>

<P STYLE="font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt 0"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt 0">XORTX was incorporated under the laws of Alberta, Canada on August 24,
2012, under the name ReVasCor Inc. and continued under the Canada Business Corporations Act on February 27, 2013, under the name of XORTX
