under the laws of British Columbia, the Company changed its name to &ldquo;XORTX Therapeutics Inc.&rdquo; and XORTX Pharma Corp. became
a wholly-owned subsidiary. The Company&rsquo;s operations and mailing address is 3710 &ndash; 33<SUP>rd</SUP> Street NW, Calgary, Alberta,
Canada T2L 2M1 and its registered address is located at 250 Howe Street, 20<SUP>th</SUP> Floor, Vancouver, British Columbia, V6C 3R8.
The Company&rsquo;s shares trade on the TSX Venture Exchange (&ldquo;<B>TSXV</B>&rdquo;) and on the Nasdaq Stock Exchange (&ldquo;<B>Nasdaq</B>&rdquo;)
under the symbol &ldquo;XRTX&rdquo;, and on the B&ouml;rse Frankfurt under the symbol &ldquo;ANU&rdquo;.</P>

